        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D0806TA-26D Traditional Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's traditional style Satin Chrome single cylinder deadbolt kit has many features which ensure a product of high security. The exterior collars are made of solid forged brass. The 1 inch deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforced strike plate with 3 inch long screws for additional security.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe interiors have large oval turnpieces which are both aesthetically pleasing and easy to operate. Fits a standard 2-1/8\" door prep. Deadbolt kit includes lock cylinder with collar, deadbolt assembly, faceplate and strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia D0806TA-26D Traditional Single Cylinder Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Optional 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Omnia-D0806-install.pdf?v=1704262247\"><b>Omnia Deadbolt Installation Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly 3 Deadbolts Left.\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
